"""superstrike-gui — control panel for the Logitech G PRO X 2 SUPERSTRIKE.

GTK4/libadwaita front end over libss2k.so (src/ss2k.c). All device I/O runs
on one worker thread; widgets are only touched from the GTK main loop.
"""
